# The charges of the generated term differential cases (codegentest.StructTermCases) on every target: the units the
# engine's closure backend, bytecode VM and iterative VM, the node and the typed generated Go parsers and the
# generated TypeScript parser charge for each input, and the outcome (ok, or the error) each reports. The targets
# charge terms in their own ways today, so the columns differ; the golden freezes each, so that a change of a
# term's charges on one target is a stated change. Some terms leave struct fields unset.
# A run checks every entry of its scope: an entry that is missing, stale or different fails. -update replaces the
# entries of the scope, drops stale ones and logs a summary per case. Review the diff: it is a regression freeze.
